3e"},{"id":248926198,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\u003cp\u003e\"South Africa\u0026rsquo;s emissions by 2025 and 2030 will be in a range between 398 and 614 Mt CO\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e\u0026ndash;eq, as defined in national policy.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\"The adaptation component of South Africa\u0026rsquo;s INDC will address adaptation through six goals, underpinned by key elements of adaptation planning, costing of adaptation investment requirements, equity, and means of implementation.\" [Further described below]\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248926275,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\"In 2025, South Africa’s annual GHG emissions will be in a range from 398-510 Mt CO2- eq. In 2030, South Africa’s annual GHG emissions will be in a range from 350-420 Mt CO2-eq.\""},{"id":248926448,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\"South Africa’s annual GHG emissions will be in a range from 320-380 Mt CO2-eq in 2035\""},{"id":248926743,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248926929,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commi