ctor":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"The time-frames within the PPD trajectory range that are communicated in South Africa\u0026rsquo;s INDC are 2025 and 2030, in which emissions will be in a range between 398 and 614 Mt CO\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e-eq."},{"id":248929469,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"2025 and 2030"},{"id":248929642,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"2035"},{"id":248930175,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"timeframe","indicator_name":"Timeframe for implementation","value":"\"South Africa will use five-year periods of implementation at the national level, specifically, 2016-2020 focused on developing and demonstrating the above mix of policies and measures in order to meet South Africa’s Cancun pledge, and the periods 2021-2025 and 2026-2030 for this INDC. \""},{"id":248930358,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"timeframe","indicator_name":"Timeframe for implementation","value":"\"South Africa will use five-year periods of implementation at the national level, specifically, 2016-2020 focused on developing and demonstrating the above mix of policies and measures in order to meet South Africa’s Cancun pledge, and the periods 2021-2025 and 2026-2030 for this INDC. \""},{"id":248930433,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"timeframe","indicator_name":"Timeframe for implementation","value":"\u003cp\u003e\"The South African NDC is defined as having two time frames of five years each (2021- 2025 and 2026-2030). This update maintains the same two periods of implementation:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1 January 2021 to 31 December 2025\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1 January 2026 to 31 December 2030\"\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248930606,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"timeframe","indicator_name":"Timeframe for implementation","value":"\"The period of implementation in this second NDC is: 1 January 2031 to 31 December 2035.\""},{"id":248930900,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"adaptation","indicator_name":"Adaptation included","value":"Yes"},{"id":248931086,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"adaptation","indicator_name":"Adaptation included","value":"Yes"},{"id":248931162,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"adaptation","indicator_name":"Adaptation included","value":"Yes"},{"id":248931334,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"ZAF","country":"South Africa","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":nul